---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Constitution of Nigeria Privacy Policy - LogicPath Systems">
    <section class="legal-page" style="padding-top: 120px; min-height: 100vh;">
        <div class="container reveal">
            <div class="glass-card" style="padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);">
                <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 class="gradient-text">Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>App:</strong> Constitution of Nigeria (Android app)</p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Effective date:</strong> October 24, 2026</p>
                </header>

                <main class="legal-content">
                    <p>Logicpath Systems ("we," "us," or "our") built the Constitution of Nigeria app (the "App") as a free, ad-supported application. This Service is provided by Logicpath Systems at no cost and is intended for use as is.</p>
                    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our App. Please read this policy carefully. By using the App, you consent to the practices described herein.</p>

                    <h2>1. Your Data Stays on Your Device</h2>
                    <p>The full text of the 1999 Constitution of Nigeria is built into the App. Your bookmarks, notes, reading history, and preferences are stored exclusively on your device using local storage and are never transmitted to our servers or any third party.</p>

                    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
                    <p>We do not require you to create an account or provide any personal information to use the App. However, the App integrates third-party services that may automatically collect certain information:</p>

                    <h3>a) Device & Technical Information</h3>
                    <p>Device model, operating system version, unique device identifiers, and IP address — collected by Google Play Services and Firebase.</p>

                    <h3>b) Usage & Analytics Data</h3>
                    <p>Screen views, session duration, feature usage patterns, and in-app navigation — collected by Firebase Analytics to help us understand how the App is used and improve the experience.</p>

                    <h3>c) Advertising Data</h3>
                    <p>Ad interaction data, advertising identifiers, and interest-based profiling — collected by Google AdMob to serve relevant advertisements.</p>

                    <h2>3. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
                    <p>The App uses the following third-party services, each governed by its own privacy policy:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google Play Services</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google AdMob</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://firebase.google.com/policies/analytics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google Analytics for Firebase</a></li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>These third parties may have access to certain information as described above, solely to perform tasks on our behalf. They are obligated not to disclose or use the information for any other purpose.</p>

                    <h2>4. Advertising</h2>
                    <p>We use Google AdMob to display advertisements within the App. AdMob may use cookies, device identifiers, and other tracking technologies to collect information about your activities on this and other apps to provide targeted advertising based on your interests.</p>
                    <p><strong>Consent:</strong> Where required by law (for example in the EEA, the UK and Switzerland), the App shows Google's consent form before any ads are requested. You can review or change your choices at any time from "Privacy & ad choices" in the menu on the home screen.</p>
                    <p><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google's Ads Settings</a> or adjusting your device's advertising preferences.</p>
                    <p><strong>Ad frequency:</strong> Full-screen ads are limited in how often they appear, are never shown when you press Back, and are not shown immediately after another ad.</p>

                    <h2>5. Cookies & Similar Technologies</h2>
                    <p>The App itself does not use cookies. However, embedded third-party services (such as AdMob and Firebase) may use cookies, web beacons, or similar technologies to collect information and improve their services. You can manage cookie preferences through your device or browser settings.</p>

                    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Local Data</strong> (bookmarks, notes, preferences): Stored on your device indefinitely until you clear the App's data or uninstall the App.</li>
                        <li><strong>Analytics Data:</strong> Retained by Firebase for up to 14 months, after which it is automatically deleted.</li>
                        <li><strong>Advertising Data:</strong> Retained by Google AdMob in accordance with <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/retention" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google's data retention policies</a>.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
                    <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
                        <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data.</li>
                        <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Opt out of personalized advertising and analytics tracking.</li>
                        <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate data.</li>
                        <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Request your data in a portable format.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at the address below. We will respond within 30 days.</p>

                    <h2>8. Nigeria Data Protection</h2>
                    <p>We are committed to compliance with the <strong>Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 (NDPA)</strong> and the <strong>Nigeria Data Protection Regulation (NDPR)</strong>. In particular:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>We process personal data lawfully, fairly, and transparently.</li>
                        <li>We collect data only for specified, explicit, and legitimate purposes.</li>
                        <li>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect personal data.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>If you believe your data protection rights have been violated, you may lodge a complaint with the <strong>Nigeria Data Protection Commission (NDPC)</strong>.</p>

                    <h2>9. Security</h2>
                    <p>We value your trust and strive to use commercially acceptable means of protecting your information. However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

                    <h2>10. Links to Other Sites</h2>
                    <p>The App may contain links to external sites (such as the official text published by the National Institute for Legislative and Democratic Studies (NILDS), National Assembly of Nigeria). These external sites are not operated by us. We strongly advise you to review the privacy policies of any external websites you visit. We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of third-party sites.</p>

                    <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2>
                    <p>The App does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13. If we discover that a child under 13 has provided us with personal information, we will immediately delete it. If you are a parent or guardian and become aware that your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us.</p>

                    <h2>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
                    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the revised policy within the App and updating the "Effective Date" above. You are advised to review this page periodically.</p>
                    <p>This policy is effective as of October 24, 2026.</p>

                    <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
                    <p>If you have any questions or suggestions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
                    <p><strong>Logicpath Systems</strong></p>
                    <p>📧 <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);"><strong>contact@logicpathsystems.com</strong></a></p>

                    <p style="margin-top: 2.5rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">Effective October 24, 2026. © Logicpath Systems.</p>
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-content h2, .legal-content h3 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    
    .legal-content p, .legal-content ul, .legal-content table, .legal-content blockquote {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content code {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 0.95em;
    }
</style>
